# Deterministic workout selection, target and metric pager.
frames 18
step-ms 100
start-ms 1700000000000
viewport 300 300
event 2 click-id workout-0
event 5 set-value target-range 35
event 7 click-id start-workout
event 10 click-id next-page
event 13 click-id next-page
event 16 click-id session-back
